// HackTool - SecurityXploded Execution | T1555 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hktl_secutyxploded.yml
any where process.pe.company:"SecurityXploded" or process.executable.caseless:"*PasswordDump.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name:"*PasswordDump.exe"
